##Utility Class:##
System.Math: Provides constants and static methods for trigonometric, logarithmic, and other common mathematical functions.
System.IO.File: Provides static methods for the creation, copying, deletion, moving, and opening of files.
System.Linq.Enumerable: Contains the static extension methods that power LINQ (e.g., .Select(), .Where()).
System.Convert: Used to convert a base data type to another base data type.
System.Environment: Provides information about, and means to manipulate, the current environment and platform.

##Mutable Class:##
